    {"person_id": "person-001", "points": [
      {"text": "《晉書》以王羲之字逸少、為王導從子，先给出他的家世坐標。", "assertion_status": "attested", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-007"], "story_ids": ["02-yanyu-069"]},
      {"text": "《世說》中的王羲之常出現在名士清談與交遊的場面裡。", "assertion_status": "inferred", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-sc1-02-yanyu-069-main"], "story_ids": ["02-yanyu-069"]}
    ]},
    {"person_id": "person-003", "points": [
      {"text": "《晉書》記王導字茂弘；《世說》又讓他在皇儲議論與使者相見中出場。", "assertion_status": "attested", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-004", "evidence-sc1-05-fangzheng-023-main"], "story_ids": ["05-fangzheng-023", "02-yanyu-036"]},
      {"text": "與庾亮的「布衣之好」是理解其交遊網絡的一個坐標。", "assertion_status": "attested", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-p3b-wave-1-f114427662a639c512fd86d1"], "story_ids": ["02-yanyu-036"]}
    ]},
    {"person_id": "person-006", "points": [
      {"text": "《晉書》記謝安字安石；《世說》常把他放在出仕、品評與朝廷場景的轉折處。", "assertion_status": "attested", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-006", "evidence-sc1-02-yanyu-083-main"], "story_ids": ["02-yanyu-083"]},
      {"text": "劉注記其對袁宏機捷辯速的賞識，補出送別場景之外的評價位置。", "assertion_status": "reported", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-sc1-02-yanyu-083-annotation-004"], "story_ids": ["02-yanyu-083"]}
    ]},
    {"person_id": "person-008", "points": [
      {"text": "《晉書》以桓溫為傳主；《世說》中的他多在朝廷危局、問答與士人交往中出現。", "assertion_status": "attested", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-p3b-wave-1-f59e4cdd4d2bf2b6878f7d72", "evidence-sc1-06-yaliang-029-main"], "story_ids": ["06-yaliang-029"]},
      {"text": "與袁宏的關係只在明確的記室參軍任職語境中呈現。", "assertion_status": "reported", "review_status": "candidate", "evidence_ids": ["evidence-p3b-wave-1-1c294f971d7f94ecb6d1358b"], "story_ids": ["06-yaliang-029"]}
    ]},
    {"person_id": "person-009", "points": [
